{
    "title": "Manticore - Khador",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_t12) == 2",
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 9 - The Grey",
                "zh": "第九章 - 灰人"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Khador's ship is docked at the Nova Observatory. He knows we're coming. His systems are already spoofing my sensors.",
                        "zh": "卡多尔的飞船停在新星观测站。他知道我们要来。他的系统已经在干扰我的传感器了。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "I want him alive. Whatever he knows about who wanted that bomb, it dies with him otherwise.",
                        "zh": "我要活的。不管他知道谁想要那颗炸弹，他死了这些就全没了。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "khador_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:nova_lab"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:nova_lab",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to the Nova Observatory.",
                "zh": "飞往新星观测站。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "Khador",
            "text": {
                "en": "The Manticore. Persistent. I have no quarrel with you. My work is too important to be interrupted.",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号。真是执着。我和你们没有过节。我的工作太重要了，不能被打断。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:nova_lab",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Grey Drone",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 2,
                    "count": 3,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy Khador's drones.",
                "zh": "摧毁卡多尔的无人机。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "Three Khador signatures! Two are projections. Shoot them all, the real one will show itself.",
                "zh": "三个卡多尔的信号！有两个是投影。全部击落，真身自然会露出来。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:nova_lab",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Khador Echo",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 38,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy Khador's echoes.",
                "zh": "摧毁卡多尔的幻影。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "Khador",
            "text": {
                "en": "Fascinating. You do not hesitate. Very well.",
                "zh": "有意思。你毫不犹豫。很好。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:nova_lab",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Khador",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 38,
                    "count": 1,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Disable Khador's ship.",
                "zh": "击瘫卡多尔的飞船。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:nova_lab",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "Khador",
            "text": {
                "en": "Stop. I surrender. I will come to your carrier. There is something you need to hear.",
                "zh": "住手。我投降。我会去你们的航母。有件事你们必须听。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 30000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Khador captured",
                "zh": "卡多尔被俘"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "khador_caught"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "ACT II COMPLETE",
                "zh": "第二幕 完成"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "The Grey Shadow has fallen.",
                "zh": "灰影已经覆灭。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "You built the bomb. Thousands dead. Give me one reason not to space you.",
                        "zh": "你造了那颗炸弹。数千人丧生。给我一个不把你扔出舱门的理由。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "I built a weapon against the Void. A pirate gang paid for it: Indigo Brink. Sh'Gaal was only their delivery boy. I did not know their target.",
                        "zh": "我造的是对付虚空的武器。出钱的是一个海盗团伙：靛蓝深渊。希加尔不过是他们的送货人。我不知道他们的目标。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Indigo Brink no longer calls itself that. Today they wear blue and keep the peace. You know them as the Cobalt Lancers.",
                        "zh": "靛蓝深渊早就不用这个名字了。如今他们穿着蓝色，维持着和平。你们知道他们叫钴蓝枪骑兵。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The Lancers? They were paid to clean up after the Shattering. They're the biggest contractor in Neox now.",
                        "zh": "枪骑兵？他们是拿钱来收拾“碎裂”残局的。现在他们是尼奥克斯最大的承包商。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "So they lit the fire and sold the water. The same pirates who ambushed the Nova fleet. The ones who took Hayley.",
                        "zh": "所以是他们放的火，又卖起了水。就是当年伏击新星舰队的那帮海盗。带走海莉的那帮人。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Khador stays aboard, under guard. His genius is the only thing that can undo what he made. Ace, rest. We're going after the Lancers.",
                        "zh": "卡多尔留在船上，严加看守。他造的东西，只有他的才智能收拾。王牌，休息吧。我们要去对付枪骑兵了。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 25000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Act II complete",
                "zh": "第二幕 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
